e acyl donor, thus contributing to the regulation of free levels arachidonic acid in cell (PubMed:18094042, PubMed:18772128). In liver, participates in the regulation of triglyceride metabolism through the phosphatidylinositol acyl-chain remodeling regulation (PubMed:32253259)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}